inclusion_criteria:
The criteria for inclusion in the study were:

- (1) patients with type 2 DM with glycated haemoglobin (HbA1c) values: 6%–8%;
- (2) creatinine values <1.4 mg/dl;
- (3) liver function tests were not up to three times the normal range;
- (4) no major diabetic complications;
- (5) no history of systemic antibiotic administration within the last 3 months;
- (6) no periodontal treatment 6 months prior to the study.
